line	<str>Talk to Vanstrom Klause in the Canifis pub (near the staircase). CKS</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Grab the 6 wooden planks, 10 coins, a hammer, all the steel weapons and nails, and fill your Druid Pouch if you haven't done so already before teleporting!</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Vanstrom Klause in the Canifis pub (near the staircase). CKS</str>
line	
line	<str>Grab the 6 wooden planks, 10 coins, a hammer, all the steel weapons and nails, and fill your Druid Pouch if you haven't done so already before teleporting!</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Travel to <col=800000>Mort'ton</col> (<col=800000>Mort'ton teleport</col>, <col=800000>Minigame teleport</col> to <col=800000>Shades of Mort'ton</col>, <col=800000>Barrows teleport</col>, BIP with 50 Agility, BKR and get <col=800000>Swamp Boaty</col>, or run from Canifis)</col>
